[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the pipe to the cam cover.</p><p>2. Undo the  bolts securing the pipe to the EGR valve.</p><p>3. Remove the exhaust gas supply pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021471.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit  the pipe  and tighten the retaining\nbolts to the cam cover and EGR valve.</p><p>Tighten the bolts on the EGR valve to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>EGR VALVE PIPE</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(EGR valve) 2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p>"]]